			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1960450">
									

<p>First off, let me start off by saying wow. It's incredible to see one of the <em>original mods</em> back around the site. As the person who's spent more time than anyone cataloging site history&#8230; I have to admin I'm a little nervous. Wow. Hi! How's it been going? It's really incredible to see you back on the site&#8230;</p>
<p>Now that I'm done gushing&#8230; you, as author, always have final say over your article. You can have it deleted&#8230; but you can also have us Archive it, possibly even rewrite it. Decomms are a part of site culture, and while it may be a bit shameful to have it up on the site in this manner, you can at least know that you've been inspiring people to get better. If you PM me, we can discuss your options in more detail(also I have a million questions for you about the old days).</p>

							</div>

										<div class="signature">
					<hr class="signature-separator"/>
					

<p><em>Whether you like it or not, history is on our side. We will bury you!</em></p>

